# Default: normalise text in the repository, check out with LF.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary assets - never touched.
#
# The TrueType font under src/test/resources is load-bearing: org.omnaest.svg.text
# measures with it to produce deterministic, byte-identical text advances across JVM
# invocations. Git normally detects binary content on its own, but declaring it here
# means a checkout can never rewrite the font's bytes under core.autocrlf.
*.ttf binary
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
